MediaWiki Gadgets Licensing Map

This repository contains separately licensed material. Copyright ownership and
license scope are not necessarily the same for the workspace, each gadget, and
the shared source package.

CC0-dedicated releases

The project-owned portions of these releases are dedicated under CC0 1.0
Universal as described by their package-local LICENSE files:

- Citation Formatter 0.5.4-post.1 (`citation-formatter@0.5.4-post.1`)
- Citation Formatter 0.5.4-post.2 (`citation-formatter@0.5.4-post.2`)
- VG Page Assessor 0.2.3-post.5 (`vg-page-assessor@0.2.3-post.5`)
- VG Stub Creator 0.5.3-post.1 (`vg-stub-creator@0.5.3-post.1`)
- wikEd Lite 0.4.6-post.2 (`wiked-lite@0.4.6-post.2`)
- wikEd Lite 0.4.6-post.3 (`wiked-lite@0.4.6-post.3`)

Those notices also cover the project-owned shared runtime incorporated into
the named releases. Their version-specific dedications do not automatically
apply to later releases, later contributions, or newly added gadgets. This map
lists only the latest dedicated release of each gadget; historical scopes
remain recorded in repository history.

Repository default

Unless a package-local or file-specific notice says otherwise, the
project-owned repository material is available under the Creative Commons
Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International Public License. This default includes
the root workspace, build infrastructure, tests, configuration, and repository
documentation.

